<%- include('partials/header',{title}) %><section class="page-intro"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CHOICES</span><h2>Personalization & data</h2><p class="muted">You control whether optional health context is used to tailor general wellbeing responses.</p></div></section><% if(notice){ %><div class="success-banner"><%= notice %></div><% } %><section class="panel"><h3>Optional health context</h3><p class="muted">Only enter information you choose to share. This is sensitive information. It is stored in MongoDB. When you send a chat message, the message and recent chat history are sent to the hosted Hugging Face inference service for a Gemma response. If you also opt in below, your profile and up to 14 recent check-ins are sent as additional prompt context. Review the provider's current data terms and use only information you are comfortable sending to a third party.</p><form method="post" action="/profile" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Health conditions or relevant history<textarea name="conditions" rows="3" maxlength="1000"><%= user.healthProfile?.conditions||'' %></textarea></label><label>Current medications (optional)<textarea name="medications" rows="2" maxlength="1000"><%= user.healthProfile?.medications||'' %></textarea></label><label>Allergies or sensitivities (optional)<textarea name="allergies" rows="2" maxlength="500"><%= user.healthProfile?.allergies||'' %></textarea></label><label>Wellbeing goals or preferences<textarea name="goals" rows="2" maxlength="500"><%= user.healthProfile?.goals||'' %></textarea></label><label class="rating-option"><input type="checkbox" name="healthContextConsent" <%= user.healthContextConsent?'checked':'' %>><span>I explicitly consent to using this profile and my recent self-reported check-ins (up to 14) as context for the Gemma assistant's general wellbeing responses. This is not clinical advice.</span></label><div class="form-actions"><span class="muted tiny">Uncheck to stop health-profile/check-in context being sent. Chat text is still sent when you use the assistant.</span><button class="btn btn-primary">Save choices</button></div></form></section><section class="panel"><h3>Prototype data controls</h3><p>Conversations and check-ins are saved to your account. Do not use real patient or identifying data until security, privacy, deletion/export, access controls, retention, encryption, and applicable legal requirements have been reviewed.</p></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
